Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.34,0:02:30.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To get from Hong Kong to Singapore, we'll\Nbe on the water for three full days.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.04,0:02:35.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, let's relax and keep our spirits up.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.70,0:02:38.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But first, I have a serious question.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.40,0:02:42.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell is with the\Nhigh school uniforms, you two?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.78,0:02:45.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can't you go and find\Nsomething else to put on?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.58,0:02:47.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Isn't it ridiculously hot?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.46,0:02:49.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, we are students, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.42,0:02:52.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And good students should behave\Nas such no matter where they are.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.32,0:02:54.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I guess that sounds like a stretch.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.30,0:02:56.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmph. Huh!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.60,0:02:58.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Japanese students are\Nsuch stiffs, aren't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.94,0:03:00.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So this is what they call Bushido.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.34,0:03:04.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Like they say, clear your mind\Nand even flames feel cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.32,0:03:07.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's all well and good, but that\Nreally won't get you any girls.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.60,0:03:08.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let go!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.51,0:03:09.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let go of me!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.92,0:03:11.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dammit, I said get off of me!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.44,0:03:12.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shut your trap!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.35,0:03:15.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's your problem? You\Nbrat! Hey! Who's there?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.68,0:03:18.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought we agreed there'd be no\Nother passengers on board but us!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.78,0:03:20.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go! Sorry, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.20,0:03:21.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a stowaway.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.34,0:03:24.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This little brat was hiding in\None of the storage holes below!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.54,0:03:25.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stow away?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.72,0:03:26.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What you waiting for?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.84,0:03:27.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come at me!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.75,0:03:29.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll freaking break your balls!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.64,0:03:31.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell that to the police, you little shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.52,0:03:33.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I dare ya! What? The police?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.00,0:03:35.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, I'm sorry, alright?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.52,0:03:36.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, just let me go!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.80,0:03:39.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just wanted to go to Singapore\Nto see my dad, that's all!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.70,0:03:40.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll do anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.66,0:03:43.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can even put me to work for my ticket!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.58,0:03:45.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's see, what should I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.80,0:03:48.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Should I let you go or turn you in?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.56,0:03:49.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.76,0:03:50.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.67,0:03:52.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We could use another cabin, boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.78,0:03:55.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No way I'm letting you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.64,0:03:56.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's too easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.64,0:04:02.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But first, I'm gonna let the captain know.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.44,0:04:08.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, in he goes.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.88,0:04:10.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That kid's got guts.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.60,0:04:13.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is he planning to swim\Nto shore from out here?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.28,0:04:14.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What should we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.04,0:04:17.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just leave him.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.30,0:04:20.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He wouldn't have dived in\Nif he wasn't a good swimmer.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.04,0:04:26.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, he's in danger!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.60,0:04:29.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This entire area is infested with sharks!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.00,0:04:36.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This isn't good.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.12,0:04:40.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, kids!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.36,0:04:41.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's sharks out there!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.76,0:04:47.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.62,0:04:51.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aurora!
