Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.10,0:04:59.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good grief.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.40,0:05:00.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, you brat.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.24,0:05:08.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.26,0:05:21.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A girl and a runty wanted\Nthat. Just my luck. Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.26,0:05:23.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How dare you fill me up\Nlike that, you bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.84,0:05:24.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's off!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.26,0:05:29.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good grief, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.32,0:05:48.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Jotaro! Below you!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.66,0:05:51.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Something's coming after\Nyou from underwater it's not
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.74,0:05:54.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a shark and it's Racing\Ntowards you you have to get out
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.56,0:05:58.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,of there now hurry swim to\Nthe boat he's Too far away
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.62,0:06:03.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If it's at that distance,\Nleave it to my viral fat green
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.22,0:06:16.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It just disappeared that\Nthing is a stand stunning
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.98,0:06:20.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,an aquatic stand In all my\Ndealings with the occult,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.46,0:06:22.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've never heard of such a thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.38,0:06:30.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This girl, there's no way she's the...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.36,0:06:32.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Could she be that Stan's user?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.26,0:06:35.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did she try to lead Jojo into\Nshark-infested waters on purpose?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.70,0:06:38.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jeez, what's with you jerks?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.96,0:06:40.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop staring like that, it's creepy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.86,0:06:44.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have no idea what's going\Non here, but I'll fight you!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.08,0:06:45.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't underestimate me, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.24,0:06:47.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're gonna regret this.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.06,0:06:50.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One-on-one, come at me,\NI dare you, you punks!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.12,0:06:52.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is she playing us?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.70,0:06:54.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe we should toss\Nher back into the ocean.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.98,0:06:55.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.94,0:06:59.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If she is just a stowaway and\Ngets eaten by sharks, it'd be bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.50,0:07:01.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've already checked the\Nten people on this boat.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.98,0:07:03.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm positive they're all in the clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.70,0:07:06.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know who it could\Nbe other than this girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.34,0:07:09.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Isn't there a way we could\Nfind out who she really is?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.12,0:07:13.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, how is Dio doing\Nthese days? Dio, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.90,0:07:15.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.46,0:07:17.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't pretend like you\Ndon't know, you little brat.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.06,0:07:19.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, I warned you, punks!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.60,0:07:21.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You gonna be a man and talk to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.16,0:07:22.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or do you just wanna get shanked?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.88,0:07:23.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Which is it, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.26,0:07:27.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My demon blade wants the\Nblood of its 340th victim,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.94,0:07:29.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and you all look like prime cuts.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.70,0:07:30.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Heh.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.12,0:07:31.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.03,0:07:33.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's so funny, stupid jerkhole?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.32,0:07:35.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jerkhole?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.56,0:07:38.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm starting to get the feeling\Nshe's not our stand user.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.76,0:07:39.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.80,0:07:40.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But who then?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.14,0:07:42.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This girl our stowaway?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.88,0:07:44.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks for grabbing her for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.48,0:07:45.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.26,0:07:52.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, Captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.50,0:07:57.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm pretty strict when it comes\Nto stowaways on my ship here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.44,0:08:02.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You may be a girl, but if I go easy on you,\Nwe'll just get more and more stowaways.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.88,0:08:09.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think we'll lock you up in the brig\Nbelow deck until we make it to port.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.00,0:08:10.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.48,0:08:12.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd like to ask you something.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.04,0:08:16.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You verified the identities of\Nall ten men on board, haven't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.62,0:08:18.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course, they're all veterans.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.58,0:08:20.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Each one of them on this\Nship for over ten years.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.98,0:08:22.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll vouch for every single man
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.28,0:08:25.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not sure why you're\Nso worried about that
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.82,0:08:27.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,since I gave you my word\Nfrom the very beginning.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.02,0:08:29.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, by the way
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.76,0:08:38.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I must request that you not\Nsmoke on deck What were you
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.42,0:08:41.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,planning on doing with the ash\Nand butt after you were done?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.36,0:08:44.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Were you just going to toss\Nthem into these pristine waters?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.12,0:08:48.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You may be a guest on this ship,\Nbut you will abide by my rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.06,0:08:50.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You got that?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.18,0:08:59.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You got it, kid?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.44,0:09:05.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold it, Pops.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.22,0:09:09.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you don't want me to smoke\Naboard ship, then just tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.50,0:09:13.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't be a condescending prick\Nabout the whole thing, you jackass.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.58,0:09:17.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Jotaro, don't be\Ndisrespectful to the captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.52,0:09:18.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're the one at fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.76,0:09:22.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His rules don't mean shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.52,0:09:24.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be as rude as I want.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.66,0:09:25.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And you know why?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.84,0:09:29.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The captain is the stand user.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.44,0:09:30.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.72,0:09:35.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A stand user?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.58,0:09:37.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not sure I follow you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.54,0:09:38.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.10,0:09:41.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That is completely impossible, Jotaro.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.76,0:09:44.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We chose Captain Dragon\Nbecause he came recommended
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.32,0:09:46.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,with verification by the\NSpeedwagon Foundation.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.04,0:09:48.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's someone that we can trust.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.06,0:09:51.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no chance that he's a stand user.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.34,0:09:54.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold on, what's this thing, a stand?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.74,0:09:57.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've no idea what you\Nguys are talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.20,0:10:00.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jojo, random guesses will only\Nmake things more confusing!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.24,0:10:02.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you have any real proof, Jojo?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.60,0:10:05.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've found a way to differentiate\Nstand users from others.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.92,0:10:06.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.83,0:10:09.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The trick is to watch a possible Stan user
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.52,0:10:11.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,around cigarette smoke\Nbecause a single whiff!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.84,0:10:14.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Makes a vein pop up on their nose?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.62,0:10:20.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell are they all doing\Nyou're not serious Jotaro relax.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.24,0:10:25.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm lying That said it looks\Nlike we found the idiot didn't we
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.08,0:10:47.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Quite impressive, but what tipped\Nyou off that it was the captain?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.38,0:10:50.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Actually, I really didn't have a clue.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.94,0:10:56.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,However, I'd planned to try this with the\Nentire crew from the moment we arrived.
