Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.94,0:11:03.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're right, I'm not the captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.40,0:11:06.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The real captain's already sleeping with
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.98,0:11:09.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the fissures at the\Nbottom of the China Sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.18,0:11:13.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If that's true, then you can sleep\Nin the depths of hell, you bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.46,0:11:18.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dammit, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.64,0:11:22.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let me go, I can't move!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.00,0:11:26.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Trouble on the water, lies in betrayal.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.34,0:11:30.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The moon card represents\Nthe fear of the unknown.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.64,0:11:32.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Its name, Dark Blue Moon.
