Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.46,0:11:47.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,out I have no choice five on\None it is getting my hands on
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.34,0:11:50.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Her just shows that lady luck\Nis on my side. Think I'll
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.94,0:11:54.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,take a dip in these shark\Ninfested waters with a rut if you
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.46,0:11:57.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,want to save her you're gonna\Nhave to dive in after us in
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.66,0:12:01.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the ocean I have the advantage\NI can take on all five of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.68,0:12:03.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.72,0:12:06.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Act tough while you hide behind a hostage.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.26,0:12:09.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It'll take a lot more than that\Nto shake me up, you dumbass.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.60,0:12:10.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's no act.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.74,0:12:12.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is a prediction.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.82,0:12:15.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hear your Stanstar Platinum is fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.96,0:12:17.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd like to put that to the test.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.34,0:12:22.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not trying to brag, but my\Ndark blue moon is king underwater.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.38,0:12:24.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's much swifter than\Nany fish in the sea,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.80,0:12:27.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and certainly faster than\Na vulgar meathead like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.88,0:12:32.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why don't we test them out right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.68,0:12:37.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, follow me if you're not\Nafraid of a little saltwater!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.32,0:12:58.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He attacked me faster than we could fall.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.32,0:13:01.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's impossible for a human. How'd he...
