Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.18,0:13:05.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're the only one who's\Nswallowing salt water today, Pops.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.60,0:13:07.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Choke on it. Tell him, Avdol.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.86,0:13:10.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your folly was trying to\Nout-predict a fortune teller.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.52,0:13:11.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tough break.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.48,0:13:12.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well said, Avdol.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.96,0:13:25.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There he goes.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.76,0:13:28.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He talked up his stance power\Nso much I expected more,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.96,0:13:31.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but in the end he was\Njust a blabbering idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.62,0:13:33.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's the matter, Jotaro?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.34,0:13:36.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hurry and pull the girl\Nout already, would ya?
