Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.86,0:13:42.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.77,0:13:44.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you need a hand with her?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.22,0:13:46.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.18,0:13:47.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm being pulled in!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.24,0:13:52.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, those are...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.60,0:13:53.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're barnacles.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.04,0:13:57.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're a type of crustacean that\Nlives between high and low tides.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.22,0:14:00.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're on Star Platinum's arm, and they've\Ngot him stuck to the side of the boat!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.56,0:14:02.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's still got some fight left in him.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.08,0:14:05.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He must have attached them\Nwhen I hit him before.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.88,0:14:07.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn things keep multiplying.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.22,0:14:11.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My stand strength, it's being drained.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.66,0:14:13.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The captain's disappeared.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.46,0:14:15.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't see him in the water anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.00,0:14:18.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jotaro, pull in your stand right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.90,0:14:20.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you think I'm trying to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.16,0:14:25.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's why I'm sweating like\Na freaking pig, old man.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.74,0:14:27.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hurrah! Jojo!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.74,0:14:29.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jojo!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.68,0:14:39.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He fell in! We've...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.90,0:14:40.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we've gotta...
