Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.38,0:14:48.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hurrah!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.82,0:15:00.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Welcome, landlubber.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.10,0:15:04.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Glad you could join me\Nin the watery depths.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.90,0:15:08.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's where dark blue moon reigns\Nsupreme, the undersea realm.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.00,0:15:13.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bad idea to underestimate me, brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.18,0:15:15.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Could be deadly.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.78,0:15:18.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Since we can talk underwater\Nthrough our stands,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.72,0:15:22.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,how about you pop out another one of\Nthose cocky one-liners before you die?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.98,0:15:23.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.89,0:15:25.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Catfish got your tongue, brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.64,0:15:30.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, what would you like\Nafter I'm done with you? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.62,0:15:34.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It would be a shame to\Nweigh such fresh fish.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.46,0:15:35.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fish paste?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.70,0:15:37.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe a plate of sashimi?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.64,0:15:40.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll make one hell of a\Nmeal out of your stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.72,0:15:42.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't play games with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.48,0:15:45.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're trying to sound tough,\Nbut I know the truth, boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.38,0:15:49.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The real terror of all this is\Nstarting to sink into your thick skull.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.40,0:15:51.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can even tell what you're thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.40,0:15:53.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How long can he stay underwater?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.78,0:15:57.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can probably last about two minutes,\Nbut can he last longer than me?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.98,0:15:59.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Am I right, brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.52,0:16:01.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let me answer you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.22,0:16:06.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My lung capacity is three\Ntimes that of a normal human's.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.84,0:16:08.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See, for years I've been training.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.38,0:16:12.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Six minutes and 12 seconds\Nis my best submerged time.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.72,0:16:16.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You must be dizzy just hearing\Nthat number, right, brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.72,0:16:17.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.32,0:16:23.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dark Blue Moon's fins are cutters that\Nmove faster than a ship's propeller,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.16,0:16:25.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,far sharper too.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.76,0:16:27.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Before you get overconfident again,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.04,0:16:30.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you might want to take a\Ngood hard look at your stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.04,0:16:33.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seems Dark Blue Moon's\Nbarnacles have taken
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.58,0:16:35.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a liking to absorbing your stand's power.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.38,0:16:41.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How does it feel to have your life energy\Nslowly draining away from your body?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.70,0:16:46.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Trying to run away by swimming back up?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.24,0:16:48.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take a good look around you!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.76,0:16:54.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Haven't you realized, brother, Dark Blue\NMoon has created an underwater whirlpool?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.86,0:16:59.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no way you can possibly\Nescape! That's right! Swim faster!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.38,0:17:03.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll just make it harder to breathe\Nwhile your power keeps draining!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.08,0:17:08.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But it's a little too early to kill a\Nstupid, smart-ass punk like you just yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.82,0:17:10.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's been too long!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.46,0:17:11.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's still not coming up!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.98,0:17:13.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A giant whirlpool!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.52,0:17:14.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It must have him trapped!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.42,0:17:17.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where the hell is Jojo?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.18,0:17:19.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go and save him.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.62,0:17:26.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These are scales.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.22,0:17:30.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That guy's stand has\Nscales as sharp as razors.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.48,0:17:33.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There are countless scales\Nswirling in that whirlpool.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.28,0:17:36.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He wasn't bluffing when he said he\Ncould beat all five of us at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.62,0:17:38.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's like an aquarium antlion pit.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.56,0:17:43.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we dive in, it's very possible\Nwe'll be sliced to pieces.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.38,0:17:46.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His scales?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.64,0:17:54.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll take another guess\Nat what you're thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.26,0:17:56.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In a whirlpool, only one spot stays still.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.80,0:18:00.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Such mundane logic.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.62,0:18:01.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the eye.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.94,0:18:05.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I jump into the center\Nwhere he is, I can attack him.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.20,0:18:07.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's what you're thinking, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.02,0:18:11.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you believe you can hit me\Nwith that punch of yours again,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.26,0:18:13.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then come and give it a shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.70,0:18:15.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Throw your worthless stand at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.90,0:18:18.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Its power's so drained\Nit doesn't have a chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.68,0:18:20.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See if you can manage an attack,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.82,0:18:23.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,one that's even sharper than\Nthese underwater cutters.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.66,0:18:24.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm waiting, brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.40,0:18:28.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn him!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.82,0:18:30.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're completely helpless!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.70,0:18:31.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's Jojo!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.22,0:18:35.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just saw Jojo in the whirlpool. Buddha!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.66,0:18:37.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't think he's moving down there.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.60,0:18:38.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So he went limp?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.04,0:18:41.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He wasn't struggling\Nagainst the whirlpool?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.88,0:18:45.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, well, that might\Nactually be a good thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.06,0:18:49.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Weren't you gonna turn\Nme into sashimi? boy?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.06,0:18:54.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're the one who's gonna be sliced up!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.16,0:19:03.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Starfinger!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.18,0:19:11.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, did I interrupt you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.14,0:19:13.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who's going to be sashimi?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.86,0:19:17.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.02,0:19:19.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't hear you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.48,0:19:21.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're going to have to speak up.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.32,0:19:22.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're underwater.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.70,0:19:24.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But your power was being drained.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.94,0:19:27.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You let yourself go live\Non purpose, didn't you?
