Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.04,0:19:30.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You concentrated your\Npower in your fingers.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.42,0:19:32.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's what you were thinking all along.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.96,0:19:35.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not even close.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.72,0:19:40.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The only thing on my mind\Nis how gross it'll be
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.96,0:19:44.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,when I kick your stupid ass and\Nyou piss yourself under water.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.12,0:19:45.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And that's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.68,0:19:46.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bye, pups.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.46,0:19:56.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jojo!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.40,0:19:57.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's my grandson for ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.76,0:20:01.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well done, Jotaro.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.40,0:20:03.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hurry and come here!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.72,0:20:14.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That captain planted some\Nbombs after all! Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.38,0:20:17.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Send out a distress call!
