Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.24,0:20:54.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've sent out distress calls,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.82,0:20:58.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so someone should be here with\Na rescue ship soon enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.36,0:21:01.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, just what the hell is going on here?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.76,0:21:03.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't get any of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.30,0:21:04.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who are you guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.66,0:21:06.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just think of us as fellow travelers.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.82,0:21:10.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're on a journey to see your father,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.52,0:21:12.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,while I'm on one for my daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.74,0:21:21.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, that's the only fresh water we have.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.30,0:21:22.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So don't spit it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.50,0:21:23.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We need it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.41,0:21:24.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.33,0:21:25.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.12,0:21:29.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone look there! Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.92,0:21:31.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
