Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.70,0:21:57.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All the old paintings on the tomb.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.48,0:21:59.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They do the sand dance, don't you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.52,0:22:01.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If they move too quick!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.08,0:22:04.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're falling down like a domino.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.24,0:22:06.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All the birds are men by the Nile.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.88,0:22:08.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They've got their money on a bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.90,0:22:10.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Called crocodiles.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.52,0:22:13.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They snap their teeth on your cigarette.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:12.72,0:22:15.10,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,All the old paintings on the tomb
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.50,0:22:15.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Foreign types with a hookah. I say.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:15.10,0:22:17.39,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,They do the sand dance, don'tcha know?
Dialogue: 1,0:22:17.39,0:22:18.85,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,If they move too quick
Dialogue: 1,0:22:19.65,0:22:22.11,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,They're falling down like a domino
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.98,0:22:24.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Walk like an Egyptian.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:22.11,0:22:24.44,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,All the bazaar men by the Nile
Dialogue: 1,0:22:24.44,0:22:26.78,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,They got the money on a bet
Dialogue: 1,0:22:26.78,0:22:28.28,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,Gold crocodiles
Dialogue: 1,0:22:28.95,0:22:31.41,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,They snap their teeth on your cigarette
Dialogue: 1,0:22:31.41,0:22:33.62,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,Foreign types with their hookah pipes say
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.34,0:22:39.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The blonde waitresses take their trays.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.48,0:22:41.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Spin around and they cross the floor.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:40.63,0:22:43.17,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,Walk like an Egyptian
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.48,0:22:43.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They've got the moves, oh-hey-oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.00,0:22:46.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You drop your drink,\Nthen they bring you more.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.34,0:22:50.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All the school kids so sick of books,\Nthey're like the punk and the metal band.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.02,0:22:55.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When the buzzer rings, they're\Nwalking like an Egyptian.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:54.56,0:22:57.02,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,The blonde waitresses take their trays
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.68,0:22:57.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All the kids in the marketplace say,
Dialogue: 1,0:22:57.02,0:22:59.39,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,They spin around and they cross the floor
Dialogue: 1,0:22:59.39,0:23:00.65,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,They've got the moves
Dialogue: 1,0:23:01.69,0:23:04.02,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,You drop your drink then they bring you more
Dialogue: 1,0:23:04.02,0:23:06.36,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,All the school kids so sick of books
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.70,0:23:06.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Walk like an Egyptian.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:06.36,0:23:08.70,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,They like the punk and the metal band
Dialogue: 1,0:23:08.70,0:23:10.16,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,When the buzzer rings
Dialogue: 1,0:23:10.99,0:23:13.33,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,They're walking like an Egyptian
Dialogue: 1,0:23:13.33,0:23:15.54,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,All the kids in the marketplace say
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.98,0:23:17.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't find a single\Nsign of human life aboard.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.54,0:23:18.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I feel sticky from the salt water.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.00,0:23:21.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is what it means\Nto face death, damn ape.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.34,0:23:22.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thinks he's won already.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:22.67,0:23:25.75,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,Walk like an Egyptian
